{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/About_This_Game.png?t=1744259665\" />Welcome aboard the Driftwood Diner! Embark on a culinary adventure as you run your very own restaurant on a boat. After losing your home in a forest fire, you're determined to earn money and help rebuild  your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/2025-03-23_23-03-12_2.gif?t=1744259665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To succeed, grow your own ingredients and upgrade your boat. Care for your animals and nurture your garden to harvest the freshest ingredients possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/2025-03-23_23-03-12.gif?t=1744259665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve delicious meals, explore new waters, and bring joy to your customers as you sail from port to port. Every dish you create brings you one step closer to rebuilding your home and restoring your community. The Driftwood Diner is open \u2014 and your story is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Developer Note</i></strong><br>Hey! :D Thanks so much for checking out the game! I am a solo developer working on making this game the best it can possible be. I received a lot of support and great comments from the community to help shape it into a game hopefully everyone would love. If you are interested in joining the community consider joining the discord and letting me know what you think of the game so far!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609330?t=1744259665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609330?t=1744259665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/c17bd7c9a2b5b92adde328a38458f013ebef22c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744259665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/c17bd7c9a2b5b92adde328a38458f013ebef22c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744259665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/About_This_Game.png?t=1744259665\" />Welcome aboard the Driftwood Diner! Embark on a culinary adventure as you run your very own restaurant on a boat. After losing your home in a forest fire, you're determined to earn money and help rebuild  your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/2025-03-23_23-03-12_2.gif?t=1744259665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To succeed, grow your own ingredients and upgrade your boat. Care for your animals and nurture your garden to harvest the freshest ingredients possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/2025-03-23_23-03-12.gif?t=1744259665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve delicious meals, explore new waters, and bring joy to your customers as you sail from port to port. Every dish you create brings you one step closer to rebuilding your home and restoring your community. The Driftwood Diner is open \u2014 and your story is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Developer Note</i></strong><br>Hey! :D Thanks so much for checking out the game! I am a solo developer working on making this game the best it can possible be. I received a lot of support and great comments from the community to help shape it into a game hopefully everyone would love. If you are interested in joining the community consider joining the discord and letting me know what you think of the game so far!</p>","developers":["Seth Heimo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/608404606614f648b1c1aac932baed590b941b02/header.jpg?t=1744259665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116575,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie480.mp4?t=1743047196","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie_max.mp4?t=1743047196"},"name":"Driftwood Diner - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116575/914cea5728613602aa877f2e6f1c8eb11016268e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743047196","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743047196","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743047196"}}],"name":"Driftwood Diner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9.0c compliant video card with 512 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Seth Heimo